<title>CANADA: Imperial Oil Q1 share profit falls.</title>
<headline>Imperial Oil Q1 share profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			  1996</p>
<p> Shr			 C$1.21		   C$1.99</p>
<p> Net			191,000		  374,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,678,000		2,393,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 158,000		  188,000</p>
<p>		  (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: First-quarter 1996 earnings included a gain of C$250 million related to a tax refund, which was partially offset by a foreign exchange loss of C$25 million on debt redemption.</p>
<p>Company full name is Imperial Oil Ltd.</p>
<p>((Reuters Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624))</p>
